The ordering audit is decisive: `prove.sh` compiles `verification.k` with all four rules before every `kprove` invocation. `summary-test.k` only checks ground instances while importing those same rules, so it is not rule-free derivation evidence. Therefore all four canonical entries are recurrence definitions; there are no separately proved derived lemmas, operational rules, or domain lemmas in this inventory.
